# Noxentra Catalog & Tool Rules

- Prefer YAML entries in `src/noxentra/catalog/*.yaml` over new Python subclasses in `src/noxentra/tools/` unless custom install/run logic is required.
- Every tag on a tool must exist in `TAXONOMY` (`src/noxentra/tags.py`).
- Keep `INSTALL_COMMANDS` and `RUN_COMMANDS` safe (no `curl | bash`, no unpinned remote execution).
- Run `uv run python scripts/gen_catalog_owners.py` and `uv run --group dev pytest tests/test_registry.py tests/test_discover.py -q` after edits.
